    "title": "Port Rust API Gateway",
    "version": "0.5.0",
    "summary": "REST edge for the Port Rust social backend",
    "description": "Complete checked-in REST contract for the Axum gateway. Every operation documents its request body, path/query/header inputs, authentication mechanism, success body, common error envelope, correlation response header, and special cookie/redirect/binary responses. Authorization is represented by security schemes rather than a duplicate Authorization header parameter. User-Agent is supplied automatically by the client, and X-Forwarded-For is infrastructure-owned and must only be injected by a trusted reverse proxy. Internal service-to-service APIs use protobuf/gRPC and are documented in proto-reference.md.",
    "license": {
      "name": "Private repository"
    }
  },
